    "url": "https://dantri.com.vn/the-gioi/vi-sao-starlink-dac-biet-quan-trong-tren-chien-truong-ukraine-20261015093644641.htm",
    "image": "https://cdnphoto.dantri.com.vn/GILRZs7yiYvQpmZIGaqEHOn08uI=/zoom/1200_630/2026/10/15/image-9-cropped-1792031682481.jpg"
